  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Common Humanitarian Fund for Sudan is a pooled-funding mechanism to improve early and predictable funding to the most critical humanitarian needs. The CHF is coordinated an monitored by OCHA, whereas the financial administration is handled by UNDP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Common Humanitarian Fund&quot; f&#xF6;r Sudan &#xE4;r en finansieringsmekanism f&#xF6;r att underl&#xE4;tta flexibel, snabb och f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;gbar finansiering av humanit&#xE4;ra insatser. CHF:en koordineras och samordnas av OCHA medan den finansiella administrationen sker genom UNDP.</narrative>
  </description>
